  dialogues:
  - text: Good day lad. What can i help you?
    npcId: tarren
  - text: Hey! Is that my locket?
    npcId: tarren
  - text: Oh, so those are the same huh? That mean you have relation with that women.
    npcId: tarren
  - text: And that locket, i remember Tarren the dock owner having the same thing.
    npcId: thomas_mith
  - text: Hmm, you are telling me that you got found with that locket? are you her
      child or what?
    npcId: tarren
  - text: Then you should find the hermit, because i was rush to bring her to him
      then go home. Next morning i come back, the hermit say she's dead and gave
      me the locket of her. Tell me to keep it. Stange right?
    npcId: tarren
